    {"id": "F28", "title": "Unit 1 Section 6.14 notice history unknown", "detail": "Whether a written Section 6.14 notice was served on the occupant added in the April 1, 2026 continuing tenancy (within a reasonable time, generally 60 days), and whether that occupant is a co-tenant or a subtenant, was not supplied. No market-rate reset is inferred.", "source_ids": ["S16", "S15", "S37"], "status": "needs review"},
    {"id": "F29", "title": "Correction: capital-improvement petition count", "detail": "The June 2024 Rent Board workload statistics show 18 capital-improvement petitions covering 148 units, with a subtotal of 19 petitions / 149 units that includes one Costa-Hawkins petition. An earlier version of this site listed 19 petitions / 148 units (mixing the subtotal with the capital-improvement unit count). Corrected 2026-11-07 after re-reading the source PDF; see VERIFICATION.md.", "source_ids": ["S29"], "status": "needs review"},
